WEBVTT

00:08:29.876 --> 00:08:32.076
And using Bluetooth technology,

00:08:32.076 --> 00:08:35.396
even in areas where
there is no energy access,

00:08:35.396 --> 00:08:38.796
we can monitor all the way
along the cold chain to guarantee safety.

00:08:39.036 --> 00:08:40.476
And using drones,

00:08:40.476 --> 00:08:41.916
we can shorten the cold chain.

00:08:42.796 --> 00:08:47.796
Today, change is often portrayed
as expensive or scary,

00:08:47.796 --> 00:08:49.796
but you can see
that there’s nothing scary

00:08:49.796 --> 00:08:53.476
about living in a community
designed for cool,

00:08:53.476 --> 00:08:55.076
where affordable,

00:08:55.076 --> 00:08:56.236
efficient,

00:08:56.236 --> 00:09:01.876
nontoxic air-conditioning 
and refrigerators run on clean energy,